WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Welcome to EUREKA, an open astronomy platform for everyone.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
The main mission is to investigate unexplained sources in real sky observations. Practice and gallery activities are separate.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Learn the interface first with actual NEOWISE images of known asteroid 128 Nemesis.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Compare epochs, examine positions and quality flags, and check whether the same source appears to move.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
SPHEREx galaxy and star-cluster fields need compatible wavelengths and independent times before any motion analysis.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Record evidence, run checks, and export a local package. A non-match is not a discovery; astronomer review is not yet online.
